# sick Crier is refused and Ornithopter is accepted. Ornithopter has power 0, so Guardian stays 2/2 and deals 2, but the
# enlist was paid: Ornithopter is tapped and the "whenever this creature enlists a creature, scry 2" trigger scried two cards,
# the Bolt and the Lotus, which go to the bottom.

